  "description": "Lorena chose death to take revenge on the husband who ruined her life. Thrown back in time, she is determined to rewrite her destiny, protect her family, and destroy her husband. There’s only one way to win: a scandalous divorce.\n\n*“I need a wild dog… because I’m going to hunt down a hound.”*\n\nA dangerous alliance. A deadly deal. Will she be able to take everything back this time?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
